    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20463" root="سلع" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْلُوعٌ</span></b>  A man <i>having</i> [<i>the skin of</i>] <i>his head
cleft,</i> or <i>split;</i> (Msb;) <i>a man having</i> [<i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلْعَة</span>,
i. e.] <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَّة</span>; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْسَلِعٌ</span></b> . (TA.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْلِعٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Having a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْعَة</span>, i. e. [<i>ganglion,</i> or]
<i>thing like the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُدَّة</span>, &amp;c. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْلُوعَةٌ</span> The
<i>main part,</i> or <i>middle, of a road;</i> the <i>part of a
road along which one travels;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَجَّةٌ</span>:
(Ibn-'Abbád, L, K:) because it is cleft, or furrowed. (L.)

